# Alembic migrations

Async environment (`env.py`) reads `DATABASE_URL` via app settings and uses
asyncpg (official Alembic async recipe).

```bash
# from backend/
uv run alembic revision -m "describe_change"   # new revision
uv run alembic upgrade head                    # apply
uv run alembic downgrade -1                    # roll back one
```

Or from the repo root: `make migrate`.
